Subject: [PATCH] Add MOS 6502 targets (llvm-mos backend)

- rustc_target: Arch::Mos, MOS calling convention matching llvm-mos Clang,
  built-in targets mos-unknown-none, mos-sim-none, mos-c64-none sharing
  spec/base/mos.rs.
- rustc_llvm: initialise the MOS LLVM target.
- core: c_int is 16 bits on MOS.
